How to configure a huawei router to enable BGP ORF negotiation for receiving route filters from a peer?
```json
{
  "commands": [
    "system-view",
    "bgp {as-number}",
    "peer {ip-address} capability-advertise orf ip-prefix receive",
    "commit"
