To configure BGP ORF negotiation for receiving route filters from a peer on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        neighbor <ip-address>
            outbound-route-filtering
                extended-community
                    send-orf
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your BGP group name and `<ip-address>` with the specific neighbor IP address where you want to enable ORF negotiation. This configuration enables the router to negotiate the send capability for BGP outbound route filtering with the specified peer.
------------
