To enable BGP's capability of sending/receiving multiple paths per prefix for IPv4 unicast in the BGP group named "transit-peers", use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp group "transit-peers" 
add-paths ipv4 send 3 receive
exit
```

This configuration enables the add-paths capability for IPv4 unicast, allowing the router to send up to 3 paths per prefix and receive multiple paths from peers in the "transit-peers" group.
