## Proposed answer:
To configure BGP on a Nokia router for best-external advertisement of labeled-unicast IPv6 routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    rapid-update label-ipv6
    extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4
exit
```

These commands:
1. Enable rapid updates specifically for label-ipv6 routes to ensure fast propagation of changes
2. Configure extended next-hop encoding to properly handle labeled IPv6 routes

The configuration ensures efficient advertisement of best-external labeled-unicast IPv6 routes while maintaining proper next-hop handling.
