## Proposed answer:
To enable VPN IPv6 and label IPv4 routes to be advertised with an IPv6 next-hop address for BGP sessions over IPv6 transport on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```bash
configure router bgp
    extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4 vpn-ipv4
