configure router bgp aggregator-id-zero
```

This command can also be applied at the group or neighbor level if needed:

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> aggregator-id-zero
```

or 

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address> aggregator-id-zero
```
