How to configure TCP authentication with keychain "BGP_secure123" for BGP sessions on huawei routers?
```json
{
  "commands": [
    "system-view",
    "keychain BGP_secure123 mode periodic daily",
    "tcp-authentication key-id 1 algorithm sha-256",
    "tcp-authentication key-id 1 key-string cipher Huawei@123",
    "quit",
