To enable BGP tunneling for next-hop resolution of IPv4 /32 prefixes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp next-hop-res labeled-routes transport-tunnel
configure router bgp extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4
```

These commands configure BGP to use tunnels for next-hop resolution of labeled IPv4 routes and enable the extended next-hop encoding capability for labeled IPv4 prefixes.
