To configure Nokia routers to prefer BGP routes with valid RPKI origin validation states over those with not-found or invalid states, use the following command:

```
configure router bgp best-path-selection
    compare-origin-validation-state
exit
```

This command modifies the BGP path selection algorithm to consider RPKI origin validation states, preferring valid routes over not-found routes, and not-found routes over invalid routes.
