To configure a Nokia router for a BGP confederation with AS 65001 and include member ASes 65100 and 65200, use the following CLI commands:

```plaintext
configure router bgp
    autonomous-system 65001
    confederation
        peer-as 65100
        peer-as 65200
    exit
exit
```

This configuration sets the main AS to 65001 and defines the member ASes (65100 and 65200) within the confederation.
