To make BGP best path selection fully deterministic when comparing routes with MED values from different neighbor ASes on a Nokia router, use the following configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        deterministic-med
        always-compare-med zero
    exit
exit
```

These commands ensure:
1. `deterministic-med` groups paths by neighbor AS before MED comparison
2. `always-compare-med zero` enforces MED comparison across different neighbor ASes while treating missing MED attributes as 0
