To configure the Nokia router to treat EBGP and IBGP paths equally for IPv6 VPN routes during best path selection, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp best-path-selection
    ebgp-ibgp-equal vpn-ipv6
exit
```

This command ensures that the BGP decision process ignores the difference between EBGP and IBGP routes when selecting the best path for IPv6 VPN routes.
