## User question:
How to configure a Nokia router to indicate BGP graceful restart support for NOTIFICATION messages when establishing sessions with peers?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure BGP graceful restart support for NOTIFICATION messages on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp graceful-restart
    enable-notification
exit
```

Alternatively, if you want to configure it at the BGP group or neighbor level:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> graceful-restart
    enable-notification
exit
```

or

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address> graceful-restart
    enable-notification
exit
```
