To configure the Nokia router to drop a BGP peer immediately when its resolving route is removed without waiting for the hold timer, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    no graceful-restart
    rapid-withdrawal
exit
```

These commands disable graceful restart (which includes the hold timer functionality) and enable rapid withdrawal to ensure immediate action when routes are removed.
