To enable updated BGP error handling procedures on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        enable-notification
    exit
    enforce-first-as
exit
```

These commands:
1. Enable BGP graceful restart with notification support (`enable-notification`)
2. Enforce first AS validation for EBGP sessions (`enforce-first-as`)

Both features contribute to more robust error handling in BGP sessions.
