To configure a Nokia router to apply the "INTERNAL-BGP" route policy for controlling outbound BGP routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
export "INTERNAL-BGP"
exit
```

This applies the "INTERNAL-BGP" policy to all outbound BGP routes from the router. The policy itself would need to be previously defined in the policy configuration section with the desired route filtering and manipulation rules.
