```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        restart-time <seconds>
        enable-notification
    exit
exit
```

Replace `<seconds>` with your desired restart duration (up to 4095 seconds). This configuration enables graceful restart with notification support and sets the advertised restart time at the global BGP level, which will apply to all address families including label-IPv6.
