To configure next-hop-resolution options for labeled-unicast IPv6 routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp next-hop-res labeled-routes
    rr-use-route-table
exit
```

This configuration enables the router to use the route table for resolving next-hops of labeled-IPv6 routes, which is particularly useful for Route Reflectors that do not participate in tunnel signaling protocols.
