## User question:
How to configure Nokia router to resolve next-hop for unlabeled IPv6 BGP routes using shortcut tunnels?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to resolve next-hop for unlabeled IPv6 BGP routes using shortcut tunnels, you need to enable the use of BGP routes for next-hop resolution under the BGP next-hop resolution context:

```
configure router bgp next-hop-res
    use-bgp-routes
exit
```

This command enables recursive next-hop resolution for unlabeled IPv6 BGP routes using BGP routes (including tunnel routes) up to four levels deep.
---
