To configure a Nokia router to enforce a locally-defined restart time of 300 seconds for all AFI/SAFI included in a BGP peer's GR capability during long-lived graceful restart, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp graceful-restart
    restart-time 300
exit
```

