To configure a Nokia router to impose a local LLGR stale time of 86400 seconds when receiving an LLGR capability from a BGP peer, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp graceful-restart
    restart-time 86400
exit
```

This command sets the BGP graceful restart time to 86400 seconds at the global BGP level. The change will apply to all BGP peers that support LLGR capability.
