---
## Proposed answer:
To configure BGP on a Nokia router with a hold time of 120 seconds and reject sessions proposing hold times below 60 seconds, use these CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    hold-time 120
    min-hold-time 60
``` 

Note: The `min-hold-time` command enforces the minimum acceptable hold time from peers, while `hold-time` sets your advertised hold time.
