## User question:
How to enable load balancing for multiple IBGP paths with equal cost on a Nokia router?
---
## Proposed answer:
To enable load balancing for multiple IBGP paths with equal cost on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    ibgp-multipath
exit
```

If you also want to include EBGP paths in the load balancing (EIBGP load-balancing), add:

```
configure router bgp best-path-selection
    ebgp-ibgp-equal ipv4 ipv6
exit
```
