To configure Nokia routers to exclude BGP router ID comparison for MVPN IPv6 paths during best path selection, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        ignore-router-id include-internal mvpn-ipv6
    exit
exit
```

This configuration will instruct BGP to skip the router ID comparison when selecting the best path for MVPN IPv6 routes.
