## User question:
How to configure Nokia router to exclude BGP identifier comparison for MVPN IPv4 and IPv6 paths when selecting the best path?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to exclude BGP identifier comparison for MVPN IPv4 and IPv6 paths in the best path selection process, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp best-path-selection
    as-path-ignore mvpn-ipv4 mvpn-ipv6
exit
```

This configuration will make the BGP best path selection process ignore the AS path length for both MVPN IPv4 and IPv6 routes. Note that this affects the entire BGP best path selection algorithm for these address families.
