To configure inbound route filtering on a Nokia router using BGP with the policy "CUST_A_IN" followed by the logical expression "AND CUST_B_PREF", use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp
    import "CUST_A_IN AND CUST_B_PREF"
exit
```

This command applies both the "CUST_A_IN" policy and the "CUST_B_PREF" logical expression as filters for inbound BGP routes. The entire expression is enclosed in double quotes because it contains spaces.
