## Proposed answer:
To configure Nokia routers to immediately send BGP UPDATE messages when sessions are established with specific peers, enable the `enable-notification` command under the relevant BGP graceful restart context. Here’s the CLI configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        enable-notification
    exit
exit
```

Alternatively, if you want to apply this to a specific BGP group or neighbor:

```cli
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    graceful-restart
        enable-notification
    exit
exit
```

Or for a specific neighbor:

```cli
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
    graceful-restart
        enable-notification
    exit
exit
```
