## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 BGP paths per unlabeled IPv6 prefix while disabling the ability to receive multiple paths for the same prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 8 ipv6
    no multipath ipv6 receive
exit
```

These commands:
1. Enable advertising up to 8 multipaths for IPv6 prefixes (`multipath 8 ipv6`)
2. Disable receiving multiple paths for the same IPv6 prefix (`no multipath ipv6 receive`)
