```
configure router
    bgp
        keepalive 60
    exit
exit
```

This will configure the BGP keepalive timer to 60 seconds globally for all BGP peers under the router instance. If you need to set it for a specific group or neighbor, navigate to the respective context (`config>router>bgp>group` or `config>router>bgp>group>neighbor`) before applying the `keepalive 60` command.
