To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 labeled-unicast IPv4 paths per prefix and disable receiving multiple paths, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp add-paths
    label-ipv4 send 8 receive none
exit
```

This configuration:
- Sets the maximum number of advertised labeled-unicast IPv4 paths to 8 (`send 8`)
- Disables receiving multiple paths for labeled-unicast IPv4 prefixes (`receive none`)
