To configure a custom route preference of 150 for BGP labeled-unicast routes on Nokia routers, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp local-preference 150
```

This sets the local preference value to 150 for all BGP routes, including labeled-unicast routes. Note that this affects all route types unless further filtered by import policies.
