## User question:
"How to set the route preference to 150 for labeled-unicast BGP routes on a Nokia router?"
---
## Proposed answer:
To set the route preference to 150 for labeled-unicast BGP routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    local-preference 150
exit
```

This sets the local preference for all BGP routes, including labeled-unicast IPv4 routes, to 150. The `local-preference` command applies globally under the BGP context.
