## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 different paths per multicast IPv4 VPN prefix and enable negotiation to receive multiple routes, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        mvpn-ipv4 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
- Enables the add-paths capability for multicast VPN IPv4 routes (`mvpn-ipv4`)
- Sets the maximum number of paths to advertise per prefix to 8 (`send 8`)
- Negotiates the ability to receive multiple routes per prefix (`receive`)
