To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per multicast IPv6 VPN prefix and negotiate to receive multiple multicast routes per IPv6 VPN prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        family vpn-ipv6 mvpn-ipv6
        add-paths
            mvpn-ipv6 send 8 receive
        exit
    exit
exit
```

If you need to apply this to specific neighbors rather than a group, use:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        neighbor <neighbor-ip>
            family vpn-ipv6 mvpn-ipv6
            add-paths
                mvpn-ipv6 send 8 receive
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

