To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per multicast IPv6 VPN prefix and negotiate to receive multiple routes for this prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        vpn-ipv6 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables BGP add-paths functionality
2. Specifically configures VPN-IPv6 prefixes to:
   - Advertise up to 8 paths per prefix (`send 8`)
   - Negotiate the capability to receive multiple paths (`receive`)
------------
