To configure the Nokia router BGP for the requested multipath settings:

```
configure router bgp
    multihop 8
    ebgp-multipath 4
    ibgp-multipath
    multipath 6
exit
```

These commands set:
- Maximum total equal-cost paths per prefix to 8 (`multihop 8`)
- Maximum EBGP paths to 4 (`ebgp-multipath 4`) 
- Enables IBGP multipath (`ibgp-multipath`)
- Sets maximum IBGP paths to 6 (`multipath 6`)

Note that `multipath` without additional parameters controls the IBGP path limit when `ibgp-multipath` is enabled.
