{'Parameters': 'restrict same-neighbor-as', 'Info': 'Specifies that the non-best path must have the same neighbor AS in its AS path as the best path.'}
{'Parameters': 'restrict exact-as-path-as', 'Info': 'Specifies that the non-best path must have the same AS path as the best path.'}
