To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 different paths per multicast VPN IPv4 prefix and enable receiving multiple routes per prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```bash
configure router bgp add-paths
    mvpn-ipv4 send 8 receive
exit
```

This command enables the router to:
- Advertise up to 8 paths per multicast VPN IPv4 prefix (`send 8`)
- Receive multiple routes per prefix (`receive`)

The configuration is applied under the BGP add-paths context.
