## User question:
How to enable inter-AS label security for both VPN IPv4 and VPN IPv6 families on a Nokia router?
---
## Proposed answer:
To enable inter-AS label security for both VPN IPv4 and VPN IPv6 families on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    enforce-first-as
exit
```

This command ensures that all routes (including VPN IPv4 and VPN IPv6) received from EBGP peers are validated to have the correct first AS in their AS_PATH attribute, providing inter-AS security.
