To enable path MTU discovery for BGP sessions on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        path-mtu-discovery
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables path MTU discovery at the global BGP level, which will apply to all BGP sessions. The DF bit will be set on packets, preventing fragmentation and allowing dynamic adjustment of the MTU based on ICMP messages from intermediate routers.
