To configure a Nokia router to use the route policy "core-routes-v6" for BGP next-hop resolution of IPv6 routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    rib-management ipv6
        leak-import "core-routes-v6"
    exit
exit
```

This applies the "core-routes-v6" policy to control the importation of IPv6 routes into the BGP RIB for next-hop resolution.
