To configure the Nokia router to apply the route policy named "BGP_Resolve_Policy123" for controlling eligible IP routes in RTM during BGP next-hop resolution, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            policy "BGP_Resolve_Policy123"
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration applies the specified policy to control which IP routes in the Routing Table Manager (RTM) are eligible for resolving BGP next-hop addresses of IPv4 and IPv6 routes.
