## Proposed answer:
To set the route preference to 200 for BGP-learned routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration command:

```
configure router bgp preference 200
```

This command must be executed under the BGP configuration context (`config>router>bgp`). The `preference` parameter sets the administrative distance (route preference) for all BGP-learned routes.
