To configure a Nokia router to allow a maximum of 5000 IPv6 routes from a BGP peer with an 80% warning threshold while keeping the session active and logging only upon reaching the limit, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        neighbor <peer-ip-address>
