To configure BGP rapid updates for multicast VPN IPv6 routes on a Nokia router, you need to enable rapid withdrawal at the global BGP level. Here's the required CLI command:

```
configure router bgp rapid-withdrawal
```

This command disables the delay on sending BGP withdrawals, allowing for faster convergence when multicast VPN IPv6 routes are withdrawn.
