To configure BGP graceful restart with a restart-time of 180 seconds on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        restart-time 180
    exit
exit
```

This will set the BGP graceful restart timer to 180 seconds at the global BGP level. The configuration can also be applied at the group or neighbor level if needed, using the same `restart-time` parameter under those contexts.
