## User question:
"How to configure a Nokia router to send both pre-policy and post-policy BGP route monitoring messages?"
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to send both pre-policy and post-policy BGP route monitoring messages, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    monitor bgp-pre-policy
    monitor bgp-post-policy
exit
```

These commands enable monitoring of BGP routes before and after policy application. The `monitor bgp-pre-policy` command captures routes before any BGP policies are applied, while `monitor bgp-post-policy` captures routes after all policies have been processed.
