To configure the Nokia router to import active IPv4 routes from the IP route table into BGP RIB using the policy named "core-routes-policy," use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    import "core-routes-policy" ipv4
exit
```

This command applies the "core-routes-policy" to import active IPv4 routes into the BGP Routing Information Base (RIB).
