To configure Nokia routers to use RSVP tunnels with the lowest metric for BGP next-hop resolution when multiple equal-cost paths exist, you need to configure the BGP next-hop resolution to prefer RSVP tunnels. Here are the relevant CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunnels
            family ipv4
                resolution-filter
                    rsvp
                    sr-ospf
                    ldp
                    sr-te
                    sr-policy
                    udp
                    mpls-fwd-policy
                    bgp
                    none
                exit
            exit
            family ipv6
                resolution-filter
                    rsvp
                    sr-ospf3
                    ldp
                    sr-te
                    sr-policy
                    udp
                    mpls-fwd-policy
                    bgp
                    none
                exit
            exit
        exit
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family ipv4
                    resolution-filter
                        rsvp
                        sr-ospf
                        ldp
                        sr-te
                        sr-policy
                        udp
                        mpls-fwd-policy
                        bgp
                        none
                    exit
                exit
                family ipv6
                    resolution-filter
                        rsvp
                        sr-ospf3
                        ldp
                        sr-te
                        sr-policy
                        udp
                        mpls-fwd-policy
                        bgp
                        none
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

These commands configure BGP to resolve next-hops using RSVP tunnels first (by listing `rsvp` first in the resolution filter), followed by other tunnel types. The router will select the RSVP tunnel with the lowest metric when multiple equal-cost paths exist.
