To configure tunnel types for resolving unlabeled IPv4 and IPv6 BGP routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

For IPv4:
```
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes transport-tunnel
```

For IPv6:
```
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes transport-tunnel
```

These commands enter the context where you can configure tunnel resolution options for both unlabeled IPv4 and IPv6 BGP routes. Note that the actual tunnel type selection would be configured within this context, though the specific tunnel type commands aren't provided in your reference material.
