To configure Nokia routers to allow BGP to use Segment Routing tunnels from the lowest preference IS-IS instance for next-hop resolution, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4
exit
```

This command enables BGP to advertise the capability to receive labeled IPv4 routes, allowing Segment Routing tunnels to be used for next-hop resolution. Ensure your IS-IS instances are properly configured with appropriate preferences to influence the path selection.
