To configure BGP next-hop resolution to use IS-IS segment routing tunnels for labeled routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family
                    resolution-filter
                        sr-isis
```

This configuration enables BGP to use IS-IS segment routing tunnels from the tunnel table when resolving next-hops for labeled routes.
