## User question:
Enable OSPF-based Segment Routing tunnel selection for BGP next-hop resolution on a Nokia router.
---
## Proposed answer:
To enable OSPF-based Segment Routing tunnel selection for BGP next-hop resolution on a Nokia router, configure the following commands:

```
configure router bgp
    extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4
exit
```

This command enables BGP to advertise its capability to receive labeled IPv4 routes, which is required for OSPF-based Segment Routing tunnel selection for BGP next-hop resolution.
