To enable Segment Routing tunnel selection by TE instances for BGP next-hop resolution on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4
exit
```

This command enables the extended next-hop encoding capability for labeled IPv4 routes, which is necessary for proper interaction between BGP and Segment Routing TE policies when resolving next-hops.
