            no shutdown
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Replace `<NYC-DC1-IP>` and `<LAX-DC2-IP>` with the actual IP addresses of your monitoring stations, and `<port-number>` with the appropriate TCP port number (typically 1790 for BMP). The `no shutdown` command activates each station after configuration.
