To configure the Nokia router for tunnel-based next-hop resolution for BGP labeled IPv6 unicast routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    extended-nh-encoding label-ipv6
exit
```

This command enables the extended next-hop encoding capability specifically for labeled IPv6 routes, allowing the router to advertise and receive these routes with tunnel-based next-hop resolution.
