To configure a Nokia router to use UDP tunnels for BGP labeled route next-hop resolution under the transport tunnel family, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution labeled-routes
        transport-tunnel
            family label-ipv4
                resolution-filter udp
            exit
            family label-ipv6
                resolution-filter udp
            exit
            family vpn-ipv4
                resolution-filter udp
            exit
            family vpn-ipv6
                resolution-filter udp
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

These commands configure UDP tunnels as the resolution method for BGP labeled routes (including labeled IPv4/IPv6 and VPN-IPv4/IPv6 routes) under the transport tunnel family context.
