To enable UDP tunneling for next-hop resolution on a Nokia router when using labeled routes under BGP, you need to configure the `extended-nh-encoding` command with the `label-ipv4` parameter. Here are the CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4
exit
```

This configuration enables the extended next-hop encoding capability for labeled IPv4 routes, allowing proper next-hop resolution via UDP tunneling.
