To enable recursive resolution of BGP next-hops for unlabeled IPv4/IPv6 routes using BGP routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                label-route-transport-tunnel ipv4
                label-route-transport-tunnel ipv6
        exit
    exit
exit
```

These commands configure the router to use transport tunnels for resolving BGP next-hops for both unlabeled IPv4 and IPv6 routes. The `label-route-transport-tunnel` option under the `transport-tunnel` context enables this functionality for the respective address families.
