CLIs:
use-bgp-routes
no use-bgp-routes
FuncDef:
This command specifies whether to use BGP routes to recursively resolve the BGP next-hop of unlabeled IPv4 and unlabeled IPv6 routes. Up to four levels of recursion are supported.
ParaDef:
No ParaDef found
