To enable validation for received Flowspec routes containing destination prefixes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    enforce-first-as
exit
```

This command ensures that all received EBGP routes (including Flowspec routes) are validated by checking that the first AS in the AS_PATH matches the peer's configured AS. While the reference material doesn't explicitly mention Flowspec, this validation applies to all BGP routes including Flowspec routes with destination prefixes.
