---
## User question:
"How to disable the validation of destination prefix in received BGP flowspec routes on a Nokia router?"
---
## Proposed answer:
To disable the validation of destination prefix in received BGP flowspec routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp no enforce-first-as
```

This command removes the enforcement of checking the first AS in the AS_PATH attribute for EBGP sessions, which includes flowspec routes.
