To enable BGP export route policies for VPN routes (including vpn-ipv4/6, mvpn-ipv4/6, l2-vpn, etc.) on a Nokia router, use the following command:

```
configure router bgp vpn-apply-import
```

This command will apply the base instance BGP import route policies to vpn-ipv4/6, mvpn-ipv4/6, l2-vpn, mdt-safi, mcast-vpn-ipv4, and evpn routes.
