To configure the Nokia router to apply base instance BGP import route policies to VPN-related routes by default, use the following command:

```
configure router bgp vpn-apply-import
``` 

This command enables the application of base instance BGP import policies to VPN routes including vpn-ipv4/6, mvpn-ipv4/6, l2-vpn, mdt-safi, mcast-vpn-ipv4, and evpn routes.
