## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 diverse VPN-IPv4 paths to BGP peers while disabling the receive capability, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        vpn-ipv4 send 8 receive none
    exit
exit
```

